### Summary

No code actions are available at places where one expect code actions to be available. I've created this [repo](https://github.com/kevinsjoberg/helix-ts-testcase) to showcase the problem. See the attached videos below in which I compare Sublime Text and Helix.

**Sublime Text**

https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/503025/177746991-8de41f14-4e4e-4519-9406-47ac909f34a6.mov

**Helix**

https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/503025/177747035-45032ec8-ecc0-48ed-9546-74d22b38b535.mov




### Reproduction Steps

1. Git clone https://github.com/kevinsjoberg/helix-ts-testcase
2. Follow the steps in the `README`.

